  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 28.0,
   "text": "You are free to go. We found out you are innocent. No, sir. I want to stay here. Stay in the cell? Yes, best decision of my life. Why do you want to stay in a cell? My rent expired. My landlord chased me out. So you chose prison? Free bed? Free food? Free security? Free food? The food in here is terrible. Terrible? The food here is sweet. Sweet?"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.0,
   "end": 56.0,
   "text": "Chicken on Friday. Juice every day. I eat like a king. This is prison, not a hotel. Five star. Best hotel in town. There's no room service here. Then why do you bring my food to my room? That's it. I'm dragging you out. Drag me? You will have to catch me first. Catch you? You are in a cell! Exactly. Safest place on earth. Your landlord is outside. He said sorry. He wants you back."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.0,
   "end": 84.0,
   "text": "Tell him I'm busy. Busy? Busy? Dinner is at seven. I can't miss the chicken. Sir, please lock the cell door. Lock it! You're supposed to leave! And don't forget my night food. Night food? Sweet dreams need sweet food."
  },
  {
   "start": 84.0,
   "end": 85.05,
